--- !u!114 &583031184887658994
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4765942250067213145}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9b2e9330b6674bf0a2d99ffd0b9377f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequences:
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - "Good morning Dr. Sanchez, you\u2019re finally awake.  I have concerning
        news for you."
      - So I apologize, but we must quickly move through the preliminary tests.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1740c4740c87772438b17beabdcc59f3, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - "Please don\u2019t be alarmed by the absence of a floor; remember you are
        in zero gravity."
      - "To get re-acclimated to our ship\u2019s environment, grab a bar near your
        cryopod."
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: db41ef021fe0be243a04480dc8566c85, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Roll 180 degrees.  '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fbc5ef4e76481846b4e0cd487a51728, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Good. Now roll yourself back.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36a750201e23b5942bd9a9e239d203c1, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Reacclimation examination complete. Hopefully, that helped you readjust. '
      - 'However, if you ever feel uncomfortable, I advise you to stop, take a breath,
        and recollect yourself. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fadb46ec5ee49d40b7d2e9ca2627622, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Proceeding with dexterity and physical evaluation.  '
      - Now, holding onto the bar of your cryopod as a point of contact, throw yourself
        to another bar in the chamber and grab onto it. Try not to hurt yourself.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 97f7fe2720fce8f48a998c3cc752169d, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'It seems like you have gotten your bearings pretty quickly. '
      - 'Dexterity and physical evaluation are complete. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5bce27a1d28446b49ad6912c01d81906, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 1
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - I have rerouted power to the chamber door.
      - 'Please proceed to the dormitories. Good luck, Victoria. Let us go forward
        together. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 115648ed0ce9b4949ad5fa7ab2dba060, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'To access the medical bay, you need to retrieve your wrist monitor from
        your room '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'This area has been placed into a manual lockdown. I do not know what prompted
        this course of action.  '
      - 'To proceed, you must deactivate it in the server room. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0806fb42770d1da48bb00b951b8ea1d3, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - "It seems the door to the server room was obstructed and won\u2019t open."
      - I have surged its activation devices. Hopefully, that should do the trick.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 664110dc685cc7e45a52c77cfdc3fcb7, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 4
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - "Oh. that was not what I intended\u2026 I am unable to rectify the situation."
      - "I apologize, Dr. Sanchez, but you\u2019ll need to try to make it through. "
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cacbe9962b69005419bebfb9c034ed4d, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0.5
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Manual lockdown has been deactivated.
      - Someone appears to be above you, but I am unable to establish a connection
        with them.
      - Please investigate further.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f606a2ddf6865f498d6813c4ea27faa, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Connection to medbay has been re-established. Thank you. '
      - "I now have access to the medical bay\u2019s functions. "
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39b69c9dea7f4f044b12f7213ac2e868, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Insert your wrist monitor into the dispenser next to you. This will fully
        restore your stimulant charges. '
      - You can only store a limited amount. I advise you to use them sparingly.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe017c44f7c69294fbcd8f55746c9312, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'Good job finding your wrist monitor and relinking me to the nearest terminal. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'As long as you wear it, I am able to monitor your vitals and give you remote
        instructions. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'I will need you to relink me to more terminals so I can diagnose the emergency
        on the ship. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - I am rerouting power to the door in the medical bay. I need you to return
        there and access the terminal inside.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Be advised that you are entering an area that is outside my network.
      - 'Therefore, I will not be able to communicate with you until a connection
        is resto- '
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bbd66950a4e222e4aaa4187b6ff20765, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - "It\u2019s sad to say, but I have no vital signal. A stimulant will no longer
        be of use."
      - Proceed to the facilities corridor.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1031477c722d3748901c02969e8c8fe, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
  - dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Thank you for relinking me to the server room.
      - We should be able to deactivate the manual lockdown from that panel in the
        center of the room.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 0
  failureDialogues:
    dialogues:
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - 'My sensors detected that you were not successful. Hopefully, you only sustain
        a bruise. You may still be unsteady from your long nap.  '
      - "I\u2019ll mark the exam as complete given the circumstances. I do advise
        you to take some more time to practice this maneuver."
      - "You\u2019ll get the swing of it soon, I promise. "
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30ec8ae17b41c804198239de9eeff5b6, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 1
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 1
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
    - characterName: ALAN
      dialogueLines:
      - Very funny, Dr. Sanchez. There are many ways to do the same thing.
      - Please humor me and do it by rolling.
      audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c4e9c601bf19d8b4ebd3787bf2540dae, type: 3}
      advancesTutorial: 0
      skipWithTutorial: 0
      incrementsDialogue: 0
      delayBetweenDialogues: 1
  dialogueCanvas: {fileID: 1886071226749602260}
  dialogueCanvasGroup: {fileID: 2517449878438318875}
  nameTextUI: {fileID: 4259200650379639958}
  dialogueTextUI: {fileID: 5089271874430932409}
